  "Scope": "Fixed c784498f -\u003E98c2a5b2. Fifteen equal-result public Core Count, text/native Replace, ReplaceToString and caller-destination TryReplace cases. Existing APIs without host conversion. Grouped AsciiSimplePattern route proven by the actual selector, worker eligibility and capture shape outside timing. Scalar Unicode and finite/live-token controls retain scalar selection. Warm one template; cold32 same-size templates exceed16entry cache. Complete operation including native first preparation. Setup outside timing. Complete result batches checked after timing; destination reuses fixed buffer with invariant output. Warm1.5s/min1000calls/lane, independent80ms calibration,3alternating samples,all\u003E=20ms. One120s cap; at most one focused noise confirmation. No catalog/cumulative/package/funded-replacement claim.",
